[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD013
TITLE: Training picture, probe, and exception queue
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall publish a truth track, refuse a routine clearance the probe reports as a conflict, place a non-routine case on the exception queue, and run a training picture of more than 8 aircraft while the checked limits stay 4 runways, 8 aircraft, and 2 neighbors. Acceptance is those four outcomes in the training suite, with no issued clearance for the conflict or the deferred case.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The new picture, probe, policy, and queue need a test that does not weaken the checked envelope.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The suite uses fixtures and in-memory state. It does not require a live NAS connection.
